{{- if eq .isPersonal false }}
# Personal Configuration
.config/1Password/**
AppData/Local/1Password/**
git/gh/**
## Skip winget configuration tagged as personal
AppData/Local/winget-configuration-chezmoi/*.{p,ep}.winget*
.chezmoiscripts/41-windows/pwa-install.ps1
